 <div class="u_1449234655 dmRespRow" id="1449234655"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1494290263"> <div class="u_1999588346 dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12" id="1999588346"> <div class="u_1352805162 dmNewParagraph" id="1352805162" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5"> <h3 class="text-align-left"><span style="display: initial; text-decoration: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit;">Breakfast Specialties</span></h3> 
</div> <div class="u_1880183760 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1880183760" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span class="" style="display: unset;"><span style="display: unset;">All breakfasts are made with 2 eggs and served with your choice of fresh hash browns or country potatoes, cottage cheese or fresh seasonal fruit, buttered toast, English muffin or biscuit and gravy. Try adding saut&eacute;ed onions and mushrooms on top of any steak order.</span> 
</span></p></div> 
